== Effects ==
* Using an active item will drop it onto a pedestal on the ground.
* When Isaac takes damage, there is a 2% chance one of Isaac's passive items will drop on the ground.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} Butter! can sometimes spawn within the special bedroom created by {{i|Lil Portal}}.{{dlc-}}
* Single-use Active items do not drop and are consumed as normal.
* Tainted characters with active items in their consumable slots can drop them from getting hit, however they will only be able to pick it back up into the active item slot.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Adds 2% more chance to drop one of Isaac's passive items per copy.
* {{i|Blank Card|r}} / {{i|Clear Rune|r}}: When dropped upon usage, their recharge times are reset to 4, allowing to use more expensive cards and runes much more frequently.
* {{i|Esau Jr.}}: Using Esau Jr. while holding Butter! will spawn another copy of Esau Jr.
* {{i|Void}}: Items that are [[#No Effect|normally unusable]] when holding Butter! can still activate their effects if absorbed by Void.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Book of Virtues}}: The item on top of Book of Virtues will be dropped on the ground, but the book itself cannot be dropped from using it, nor form taking damage.
* {{i|Damocles}}: Dropped active items will not cause extra item pedestals to spawn, nor can getting hit cause Isaac to drop an activated Damocles.
* {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}: Glowing hourglass functions as normal.
* {{i|How to Jump|nr}}: Isaac animates a jump but his movement remains normal and he cannot go over any [[obstacle]]s.
** {{dlc|r}} A normal jump is made before dropping the item.
* {{i|Mama Mega!}} + {{e|Golden Bomb}}: Since Mama Mega is not consumed if Isaac has a golden bomb, it will be dropped after activation.
* {{i|Metronome|nr}}: Effect from the Metronome is immediately canceled beyond the gain of hearts, coins, bombs, or keys. Visual effects may persist until leaving the room.
** {{dlc|r}} Granted item effects will last until leaving the room.
* {{i|Missing No.|nr}}: Butter! can get rid of Missing No..
* {{i|Notched Axe|r}}: Notched Axe is dropped when the charge bar is empty.
* {{i|The Pinking Shears|nr}}: The flight granted by The Pinking Shears persists, but the body familiar is immediately canceled.
** {{dlc|r}} The familiar remains.
* {{i|Razor Blade|nr}}: Deals damage to Isaac as normal but does not increase damage for the current room.
** {{dlc|r}} Does increase damage.

== Strategy ==
* Butter! allows the transportation of active item pedestal from room to room. On its own this ability is useless, but can be used to set up plays involving room-wide pedestal effects; after gathering all available active item pedestal in a single room, Isaac can then:
** Use {{i|The D6}}, {{p|Dice Shard}}, {{t|Cracked Dice}} etc., to re-roll every single item pedestal in the room.
** Use {{i|Void}}, {{p|Black Rune}}, or {{i|Abyss}} to consume all pedestal for their respective benefits.
** Use {{i|Diplopia}} (or more riskily {{i|Crooked Penny}}) to double all item pedestals before doing any of the above.
* Isaac can also damage himself to try to fish for the 2% chance of dropping a passive item in the same room as well.

